  "system": {
    "summary": {
      "value": ""
    },
    "description": "<p>When you get a Result of <strong>13 or higher</strong> on a Check performed to investigate a creature, item or location — this includes using the <strong>Study</strong> action during a conflict — you may ask the Game Master up to <strong>【SL】</strong> questions concerning the subject of your investigation. You may ask these questions immediately or save them for later; whenever you ask one of these questions, the Game Master will answer truthfully and you will describe your character's deductive process.</p><p>This Skill may only be used once on the same creature, item, or location.</p>",
